 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Of course. Make plan together and keep it as simple as possible. Things like where he eats and sleeps can be decided on ahead of time, so there are fewer surprises. Then stick familiar routines. A familiar place, even for an hour, can help a lot. If he enjoys them, yes. But keep them short and back in familiar territory. A long walk in a new park, for example, could be lot of confusion. That's understandable. You don't have to hide it. Talk about it together and agree how you' support each other.",
